Package: cellchatrs
Type: Package
Title: Rust-Accelerated CellChat Inference Kernel
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("cellchat-rs", "authors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@example.org")
Author: cellchat-rs authors [aut, cre]
Maintainer: cellchat-rs authors <noreply@example.org>
URL: https://github.com/cellchat-rs/cellchatrs
BugReports: https://github.com/cellchat-rs/cellchatrs/issues
Description: Drop-in accelerator for the CellChat cell-cell communication inference
    kernel. Provides a byte-compatible re-implementation of 'computeCommunProb' and the
    surrounding numerics, transparently overriding the equivalent functions of the
    'CellChat' package when both are installed.
